## Technical Status

Wind Tunnel Lab currently uses a simplified two-dimensional incompressible stable-fluids solver for educational visualization.

The project is not represented as a validated CFD package or an experimentally verified engineering tool. Its numerical outputs are approximate and subject to the limitations described in `DISCLAIMER.md` and `docs/limitations.md`.

